You use SklaffKOM by typing commands.

Articles are read and written in conferences, which work much like
discussion forums. You can also send private mail, play games, and
upload or download files.

A suggested command is shown at the bottom of the screen.
Press ENTER without typing anything to use it.

Some useful commands to get you started:

List conferences     : Show which conferences are available
Subscribe (to)       : Join a conference
Write (article)      : Write an article in the current conference
Follow-up            : Reply to the article you just read
Play (online games)  : Show the online games available on the BBS
List commands        : Show all available commands

Words within parentheses do not need to be typed.

Type Help followed by a command for more information, for example Help Mail.
Type ? to display this introduction again.
